<title>USA: Cinema Ride completes financing agreement.</title>
<headline>Cinema Ride completes financing agreement.</headline>
<dateline>STUDIO CITY, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema Ride Inc on Wednesday said it has completed a financing agreement with FINOVA Group Inc's FINOVA Technology Finance Inc which will provide just over $1.5 million in equipment lease financing to Cinema Ride.</p>
<p>The equipment financed consists of seven of Cinema Ride's 3-D ride simulators in The Forum Shops at Caesars Palace in Las Vegas and at its new facility at Times Square in New York.</p>
</text>
